    "detailed_description": "Our hero awoke one day as a werewolf with no memories of his past and understanding of the world he lives in. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673560/extras/63e61c208660cb051b4d105b9eedf81a.poster.avif?t=1722777299\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673560/extras/63e61c208660cb051b4d105b9eedf81a.webm?t=1722777299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673560/extras/63e61c208660cb051b4d105b9eedf81a.mp4?t=1722777299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Features</strong><br><br>. <strong><i>Story driven game</i></strong> divided into 10 chapters as a tale that will unfold his dramatic scenario through handmade pixel art story board as the player will progress into the world of Aurora. Learn about the torturous past of the Wolf Knight and why the world of Aurora is at war for 1,000 years.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673560/extras/22c32784479c4372bc0066c3b74ad58c.poster.avif?t=1722777299\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673560/extras/22c32784479c4372bc0066c3b74ad58c.webm?t=1722777299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673560/extras/22c32784479c4372bc0066c3b74ad58c.mp4?t=1722777299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>. <strong><i>Challenging die and retry gameplay </i></strong>that will test your skills through wide range of challenges and enemies: armed knight, troll firing bombs, avoid arrow, destroy stone boulders, moving platforms... <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673560/extras/600aaba95773a00a9df1efe65484e2cd.poster.avif?t=1722777299\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673560/extras/600aaba95773a00a9df1efe65484e2cd.webm?t=1722777299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673560/extras/600aaba95773a00a9df1efe65484e2cd.mp4?t=1722777299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>. <strong><i>Hand drawned 2D pixel art graphics</i></strong> environment that will take you from a sunset plains, a dark cave, a magical forest, snowing mountains and many others and make you discovers all the species, tribes and people of Aurora.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673560/extras/a2cd63d4d6137f170a786bdc703e0d50.poster.avif?t=1722777299\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673560/extras/a2cd63d4d6137f170a786bdc703e0d50.webm?t=1722777299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673560/extras/a2cd63d4d6137f170a786bdc703e0d50.mp4?t=1722777299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>. <i><strong>Unique melodious musics</strong></i> that will immerse you composed by very talented artist <br><br>. <strong><i>Learn new abilities</i></strong> each time you defeat a boss to be able to explore inaccessible areas of the map. Learn double jump to reach far moving platforms, dash to avoid falling obstacles, grapple to reach inaccessible areas, become a wolf to sneak out in hidden places and learn other abilities\u2026<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673560/extras/da720d628dd9884186d13b65f09cdcf7.poster.avif?t=1722777299\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673560/extras/da720d628dd9884186d13b65f09cdcf7.webm?t=1722777299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673560/extras/da720d628dd9884186d13b65f09cdcf7.mp4?t=1722777299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>. <strong><i>Collect coins and gems</i></strong> that are spread in challenging location to push even further your skills.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673560/extras/9b70f2dd3b97dc2c290b3cebd1b17f5a.poster.avif?t=1722777299\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673560/extras/9b70f2dd3b97dc2c290b3cebd1b17f5a.webm?t=1722777299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673560/extras/9b70f2dd3b97dc2c290b3cebd1b17f5a.mp4?t=1722777299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>. <strong><i>Use a map</i></strong> to travel in the wide interconnected world, and don\u2019t hesitate to backtracking to progress in the adventure<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673560/extras/02a8be99ad9deae693b34a926cfd9804.poster.avif?t=1722777299\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673560/extras/02a8be99ad9deae693b34a926cfd9804.webm?t=1722777299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2673560/extras/02a8be99ad9dea